{"embedding_dim": 768, "data": [{"__id__": "ent-4446d1f4aab08c7c7f072e1e28f0b08c", "__created_at__": 1754068653, "entity_name": "The Mirror", "content": "The Mirror\nThe Mirror appears to be a magical portal that connects the real world with a timeless realm.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-856d0439cf3f53f3e58be06e398f5c21", "__created_at__": 1754068653, "entity_name": "The Crow", "content": "The Crow\nThe Crow is an enigmatic guide that speaks in riddles and helps Marisol navigate the mirror world.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-4840d2555bd5f0b995eb76723c6c9055", "__created_at__": 1754068653, "entity_name": "Bedroom", "content": "Bedroom\nMarisol's bedroom is described as growing cold and unused.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-0e05937bddc6620a746f3116dee0b46c", "__created_at__": 1754068653, "entity_name": "Marisol", "content": "Marisol\nMarisol is a character who discovers an old mirror in the attic and enters a mystical garden through its reflection.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-8914fa4926641df00f1b2a4fda3f0782", "__created_at__": 1754068653, "entity_name": "Attic", "content": "Attic\nThe Attic is a location where Marisol finds the old mirror and enters the mirror realm.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-6f787e9aae66147e8acef90af362d3ac", "__created_at__": 1754068653, "entity_name": "The Woman in Smoke Hair", "content": "The Woman in Smoke Hair\nThe Woman in Smoke Hair is a mysterious figure who beckons Marisol into the mirror realm.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-31f437ff8a48d1a300819d1236e58dc7", "__created_at__": 1754068653, "entity_name": "The Garden", "content": "The Garden\nThe Garden is a mystical, dreamlike place where time and reality are distorted.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-9dafe3747e06aa15af0bfba521f66346", "__created_at__": 1754068653, "entity_name": "Parents", "content": "Parents\nMarisol's parents are mentioned as calling her name in empty halls.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-fbea3636dd05a6288a7fd77ce507ee71", "__created_at__": 1754068654, "entity_name": "Rain and Lavender", "content": "Rain and Lavender\nThe scent of rain and lavender is associated with the south wind on a particular evening.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}], "matrix": ""}